WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.767 --> 00:00:02.369
♪ (SLOW SOMBER MUSIC PLAYS) ♪

00:00:04.237 --> 00:00:06.106
RICHARD RYAN:
I'm Richard, what's your name?

00:00:06.572 --> 00:00:07.206
Mare.

00:00:07.506 --> 00:00:09.876
Give it up
for Ms. Ladyhawk herself!

00:00:09.976 --> 00:00:11.610
(AUDIENCE CHEERS)

00:00:12.011 --> 00:00:13.379
RYAN:
<i>Why do they call you "Ladyhawk?"</i>

00:00:13.846 --> 00:00:15.915
MARE SHEEHAN:<i> I made a shot
 in a basketball game,</i>

00:00:16.015 --> 00:00:16.982
<i> twenty-five years ago.</i>

00:00:17.349 --> 00:00:19.418
They think you're a hero!

00:00:19.952 --> 00:00:21.754
Oh, I love it, look at that.

00:00:21.854 --> 00:00:22.989
It must've been some shot.

00:00:23.289 --> 00:00:24.757
MARE: Most places, no.

00:00:25.024 --> 00:00:27.727
Around here... yeah.

00:00:28.161 --> 00:00:29.328
RYAN:<i> What do you do, Mare?</i>

00:00:29.428 --> 00:00:31.931
-I'm a detective.
-A detective?

00:00:32.432 --> 00:00:35.168
You don't have any bodies
hidden under your porch, do you?

00:00:35.535 --> 00:00:36.802
Uh, not yet, no.

00:00:37.336 --> 00:00:40.140
♪ (DRAMATIC MUSIC PLAYS) ♪

00:00:42.408 --> 00:00:44.277
MARE:<i> The Easttown
 Police Department received</i>

00:00:44.377 --> 00:00:47.714
a call reporting a dead body
in Creedham Creek.

00:00:49.315 --> 00:00:51.483
KENNY MCMENAMIN:<i> Get
the son of a bitch who did this.</i>

00:00:52.218 --> 00:00:54.587
'Cause if you don't,
I'll kill him myself.

00:00:56.923 --> 00:00:58.057
RYAN:<i> Tell me about your father.</i>

00:00:58.391 --> 00:00:59.758
SHEEHAN:<i> He was my best friend.</i>

00:00:59.859 --> 00:01:01.627
He passed away
when I was 13.

00:01:02.094 --> 00:01:03.430
<i> He was a detective.</i>

00:01:05.098 --> 00:01:06.332
RYAN:<i> At least you
 still got your mother.</i>

00:01:06.733 --> 00:01:08.301
MARE:<i> Oh,
 we can't stand each other.</i>

00:01:10.402 --> 00:01:12.839
I can feel it happening again.

00:01:14.273 --> 00:01:15.508
<i> This expectation from people</i>

00:01:15.608 --> 00:01:18.644
to be something I don't think
I'm good enough to be.

00:01:19.712 --> 00:01:22.315
CHIEF CARTER:<i> Mare, I know
 what you've been through.</i>

00:01:23.049 --> 00:01:24.717
And I know you're worth saving.

00:01:26.553 --> 00:01:28.621
(CROWD CLAMORING)

00:01:28.721 --> 00:01:30.489
The ground has just fallen
out beneath you.

00:01:30.589 --> 00:01:32.758
Mom, you don't know what's
gonna happen, all right?

00:01:33.125 --> 00:01:34.159
(TIRES SCREECHING)

00:01:34.460 --> 00:01:38.565
Go back to the file, dig deep,
recommit yourself.

00:01:40.399 --> 00:01:43.136
Doing something great
is overrated.

00:01:43.236 --> 00:01:44.471
Put the gun down!

00:01:44.571 --> 00:01:45.404
(SIREN WAILING)

00:01:46.139 --> 00:01:50.110
People expect that
from you... all the time.

00:01:52.010 --> 00:01:53.780
♪ (MUSIC INTENSIFIES) ♪

00:01:55.247 --> 00:01:57.383
-(PANTING)
-(SIRENS WAILING)

